{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 6528242094918857847,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Labeling",
      "source_hash": 6347446485974483298,
      "context_hash": 6350509658840991011,
      "translation": "레이블 지정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095076Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "You can apply GitHub labels to an issue or PR by posting a comment.",
      "source_hash": 14137039724128667575,
      "context_hash": 9644962322430796840,
      "translation": "댓글을 작성하여 이슈나 PR에 GitHub 레이블을 적용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095078Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Labeling of issues can be very helpful for searching, tying issues together, and indicating information in a formal way, such as the status.",
      "source_hash": 11023101538249256868,
      "context_hash": 6835216042007777456,
      "translation": "이슈에 레이블을 지정하면 검색하거나, 이슈들을 서로 연결하거나, 상태와 같은 정보를 공식적인 방식으로 나타내는 데 매우 유용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095079Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The Triage WG helps with labeling issues.",
      "source_hash": 17988338819733102490,
      "context_hash": 2585753173054504601,
      "translation": "트리아지 WG는 이슈에 레이블을 지정하는 일을 돕습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triage": "트리아지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095080Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "If you are interested in helping triaging issues, see the [Triage WG procedure](../release/triage-procedure.md).",
      "source_hash": 14943417614244535616,
      "context_hash": 4871934135555164080,
      "translation": "이슈 트리아지를 돕는 데 관심이 있다면 [트리아지 WG 절차](../release/triage-procedure.md)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triage": "트리아지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095080Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 13595448260578220107,
      "translation": "사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095081Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The general form of the comment should be `@rustbot label` followed by a space-separated list of labels to add or remove.",
      "source_hash": 11088373367166716938,
      "context_hash": 16265762939408225605,
      "translation": "댓글의 일반적인 형식은 `@rustbot label` 뒤에 추가하거나 제거할 레이블 목록을 공백으로 구분하여 붙이는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095081Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "You can remove labels by prefixing them with the `-` character.",
      "source_hash": 4083989069155508399,
      "context_hash": 10642877120477575436,
      "translation": "레이블 앞에 `-` 문자를 붙이면 해당 레이블을 제거할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095081Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Some examples:",
      "source_hash": 13116419464886084737,
      "context_hash": 876866444239562319,
      "translation": "몇 가지 예시는 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095081Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot label A-diagnostics A-macros`",
      "source_hash": 1344235711275288887,
      "context_hash": 16964386454999057778,
      "translation": "`@rustbot label A-diagnostics A-macros`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095082Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot label +T-lang -T-compiler` --- Removes `T-compiler` and adds `T-lang`.",
      "source_hash": 2521486928354447816,
      "context_hash": 690903008419955117,
      "translation": "`@rustbot label +T-lang -T-compiler` --- `T-compiler`를 제거하고 `T-lang`을 추가합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095082Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Labels are parsed and applied from left to right (canceling conflicting labels).",
      "source_hash": 7148749848070681693,
      "context_hash": 3256105808823134962,
      "translation": "레이블은 왼쪽에서 오른쪽 순서로 파싱되어 적용됩니다(충돌하는 레이블은 서로 상쇄됩니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095082Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Example:",
      "source_hash": 2367275816953728862,
      "context_hash": 1593958856188918850,
      "translation": "예시는 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095083Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The syntax for the command is somewhat flexible, supporting a few different forms to suit your pleasure.",
      "source_hash": 14055786232098646965,
      "context_hash": 1099003030769488320,
      "translation": "이 명령의 구문은 어느 정도 유연하여, 원하는 대로 사용할 수 있도록 몇 가지 다른 형식을 지원합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095083Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "Some examples of variants you can use:",
      "source_hash": 6704629235256480825,
      "context_hash": 16399507054737930329,
      "translation": "사용할 수 있는 변형의 몇 가지 예시는 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095083Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot label: +T-lang, -T-compiler`",
      "source_hash": 10543637370952969188,
      "context_hash": 1901542584691791108,
      "translation": "`@rustbot label: +T-lang, -T-compiler`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095083Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot label: +T-lang and -T-compiler`",
      "source_hash": 16626311680952866162,
      "context_hash": 6342028105603694692,
      "translation": "`@rustbot label: +T-lang and -T-compiler`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095083Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot modify labels to +T-lang and -T-compiler`",
      "source_hash": 2402937954403910199,
      "context_hash": 4343988006152851059,
      "translation": "`@rustbot modify labels to +T-lang and -T-compiler`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095084Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot modify labels: +T-lang and -T-compiler`",
      "source_hash": 13610307523017049155,
      "context_hash": 17296001168035541685,
      "translation": "`@rustbot modify labels: +T-lang and -T-compiler`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095084Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot modify labels to +T-lang -T-compiler`",
      "source_hash": 5873937809832806571,
      "context_hash": 12071320538728809775,
      "translation": "`@rustbot modify labels to +T-lang -T-compiler`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095084Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot labels \"+good first issue\"`",
      "source_hash": 14690494506643098971,
      "context_hash": 16147559807469539639,
      "translation": "`@rustbot labels \"+good first issue\"`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095084Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "The command can be terminated with a `.`, `;`, or the end of the line.",
      "source_hash": 11662214547365790623,
      "context_hash": 14924438477520471055,
      "translation": "이 명령은 `.`, `;` 또는 줄 끝으로 종료할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095084Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "Formally the grammar is:",
      "source_hash": 10046652363077083730,
      "context_hash": 6575760000865121151,
      "translation": "형식 문법은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095084Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Command → `@rustbot` `modify`? *label-word* `to`? `:`? *label-list* (`;` | `.`)?",
      "source_hash": 4997509281098550523,
      "context_hash": 10704749953811189808,
      "translation": "명령 → `@rustbot` `modify`? *레이블-단어* `to`? `:`? *레이블-목록* (`;` | `.`)?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "label": "레이블"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:52.095085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "label-word →",
      "source_hash": 6786380488025903017,
      "context_hash": 3487386318936355192,
