    {
      "id": "section:1/block:33/seg:0",
      "source": "Permissions",
      "source_hash": 16436753179177957058,
      "context_hash": 373719547277106913,
      "translation": "권한",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:34/seg:0",
      "source": "All labels can be assigned by rust-lang organization team members (and wg-triage, wg-async).",
      "source_hash": 9140063472015484837,
      "context_hash": 10113817780555850129,
      "translation": "모든 레이블은 rust-lang 조직의 팀 구성원(그리고 트리아지 워킹 그룹인 wg-triage와 wg-async)이 지정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triage": "트리아지",
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:34/seg:1",
      "source": "Users not on a team can only assign labels that are explicitly authorized in `triagebot.toml`.",
      "source_hash": 4699704354732123900,
      "context_hash": 16504647571345553639,
      "translation": "팀에 속하지 않은 사용자는 `triagebot.toml`에서 명시적으로 허용된 레이블만 지정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:34/seg:2",
      "source": "It is encouraged for maintainers to allow the majority of labels to be applied by anyone.",
      "source_hash": 10292052980465554163,
      "context_hash": 13477634584408140061,
      "translation": "메인테이너는 대부분의 레이블을 누구나 지정할 수 있도록 허용하는 것이 좋습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:34/seg:3",
      "source": "An example of one that would be restricted is `beta-accepted`, since accepting a backport to beta is usually only done by a team member.",
      "source_hash": 4928124701647693773,
      "context_hash": 12324295045248307315,
      "translation": "제한해야 할 레이블의 예로는 `beta-accepted`가 있습니다. beta로의 백포트를 승인하는 일은 보통 팀 구성원만 하기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "beta": "beta",
        "backport": "백포트",
        "team member": "팀 구성원"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 5297155264784217424,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978572Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Labeling support is enabled on a repo by having a `[relabel]` table in `triagebot.toml`:",
      "source_hash": 11690520374537564130,
      "context_hash": 16451277995988350820,
      "translation": "저장소의 `triagebot.toml`에 `[relabel]` 테이블이 있으면 해당 저장소에서 레이블 지정 기능이 활성화됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Permissions for allowing unauthenticated labeling is done by listing the labels in the `allow-unauthenticated` list:",
      "source_hash": 15384566504667737642,
      "context_hash": 2114766412120998058,
      "translation": "인증되지 않은 사용자의 레이블 지정을 허용하려면 `allow-unauthenticated` 목록에 해당 레이블을 나열하면 됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Aliases",
      "source_hash": 12621736200200300484,
      "context_hash": 5944272175465660006,
      "translation": "별칭",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The configuration also supports aliases, a single *word* that is expanded in a set of labels allowing setting multiple labels with a single command, useful when adding or removing the same set of labels over and over.",
      "source_hash": 9226655827583155394,
      "context_hash": 7887553384849306995,
      "translation": "설정에서는 별칭도 지원합니다. 별칭은 여러 레이블의 집합으로 확장되는 단일 *단어*로, 명령 하나로 여러 레이블을 설정할 수 있게 해 주므로 같은 레이블 집합을 반복해서 추가하거나 제거할 때 유용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "To configure an alias, add to the triagebot the following item:",
      "source_hash": 10923995115749495539,
      "context_hash": 5224285346471707203,
      "translation": "별칭을 설정하려면 triagebot 설정에 다음 항목을 추가하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "`add-labels` and `rem-labels` and arrays of labels that the alias will expand to.",
      "source_hash": 6122805110291147330,
      "context_hash": 4889567176674516758,
      "translation": "`add-labels`와 `rem-labels`는 별칭이 확장될 레이블의 배열입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "For example, given the above configuration:",
      "source_hash": 7908040829607209529,
      "context_hash": 16418590559081800483,
      "translation": "예를 들어, 위의 설정이 주어졌을 때:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Aliases can also be *negative*, inverting the effect:",
      "source_hash": 13131095802975206534,
      "context_hash": 17093149680646474491,
      "translation": "별칭은 *부정형*으로도 사용할 수 있으며, 이 경우 효과가 반대가 됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "You can also mix labels and aliases.",
      "source_hash": 16529137788314395573,
      "context_hash": 15721479848416306883,
      "translation": "레이블과 별칭을 섞어서 사용할 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "Self-canceling labels will be omitted:",
      "source_hash": 15884127242433344479,
      "context_hash": 211630003196431598,
      "translation": "서로 상쇄되는 레이블은 생략됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 11497874141303958255,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:44:56.978573Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`src/handlers/relabel.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/relabel.rs).",
      "source_hash": 1973863869242887174,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`src/handlers/relabel.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/relabel.rs)를 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
